+// n64to3ds: ARM11-friendly ENVMIXER3 inner loop.
+//
+// The original loop visits sample index y ^ 1 for y = 0..183, so samples come
+// in pairs that share one 32-bit word of each buffer: y = 2k uses the high
+// halfword of word k and y = 2k + 1 the low halfword (little-endian host).
+// Every word is therefore read and written once instead of each halfword
+// separately, all five buffers are addressed from one pointer with constant
+// offsets, the ramp direction is a template parameter instead of a per-sample
+// branch, and saturation is a single SSAT.  The arithmetic and its order are
